stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Allocated
  Allocated --> Receiving: stream bytes
  Receiving --> PhysicallyDurable: required data receipts
  Receiving --> Abandoned: disconnect or invalid checksum
  PhysicallyDurable --> Committed: Raft catalog commit
  PhysicallyDurable --> Abandoned: commit not executed and intent expires
  Committed --> Superseded: new version same key
  Committed --> DeleteMarked: DELETE without version for enabled bucket
  Superseded --> RetentionEligible: expiration and no refs/holds
  DeleteMarked --> RetentionEligible: no protected refs/holds
  RetentionEligible --> Tombstoned: 2-phase GC approved
  Tombstoned --> Purged: physical evidence collected
  Abandoned --> Purged: grace/recheck
  Purged --> [*]
